{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area, approach object, grab it, check weight and perform subtask, or scan again. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjPosition    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    />",
